  "assumptions": [
    "Explicit regular unrotated i-fastest metre/up grid and known reference/height datum",
    "Conservative full cells below minimum provided corner terrain; intersecting/above IDs and volume retained",
    "Pinned matrix-free products; workspace estimate excludes interpreter/JIT/dependency runtime, not a measured RSS promise",
    "Independent supplied sigma and explicit L2 reference/edges/scales; positive reference penalty for iterative inversion",
    "Conservative augmented condition bound; no dense data rank, posterior uncertainty or geological uniqueness claim",
    "Known tested near/far domain; resource budgets apply jointly and execution can fail atomically",
    "Density kg/m^3 to backend g/cm^3, upward gravity to down; magnetic physical J and SI induced conversion",
    "Linear TMI requires selected observed/full-vector weak policy; no demagnetisation or induced/remanent decomposition"
  ]
